    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d360">

                <pb facs="0489" n="371" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg371"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.003/758: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American Delegation at
                        the Chinese Tariff Conference</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-08-27T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 27,
                                1926—2 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>41. With reference to Conference 57 August 7, 3 p.m. and 59, August 27, 3
                        p.m.,<anchor n="55" xml:id="d360-f1"/> you may inform Arnold that he has
                    been designated as American delegate to Tariff Revision Commission at Shanghai.
                    Department is informed that Arnold has received instructions from Department of
                    Commerce in this regard.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
